  "name": "Grilled Salmon with Lemon-Tarragon Garlic Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Charred salmon with a bright, creamy herb topping",
  "description": "Seasoned salmon fillets are grilled and served with a tangy mayonnaise, lemon, tarragon, and garlic sauce.",
  "meal_type": "sauce",
